    "ix.30": "Chart paper or a projected space for three shared columns: <b>Hunches · Know · Need-to-Know</b> (the KWHL chart).",
    "ix.31": "Vetted sources for investigation (district-approved). Suggested public-domain and Texas .gov / .org sources are listed in the facilitator guide.",
